{"name":"Equestrian","title":"Equestrian","revision":200657,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Equestrian","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Although equestrians are often ignorantly called \"Horse Girls\", the aesthetic of being an equestrian is very different. A \"Horse Girl\" is typically understood to be a young girl in a \"horse phase\" who acts like a horse, only talks about horses, and is generally crazy about horses. An equestrian, on the other hand, can be a person of any gender who appreciates horses and the art of riding."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visual"},{"kind":"list","text":"Riding Bareback"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horse Shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jumping"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dressage"},{"kind":"list","text":"Barrel Racing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Breakaway Roping"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stables"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tack Rooms"},{"kind":"list","text":"Moments of Connection Between Horse and Ride"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The fashion consists mostly of traditional and modern English and Western riding attire"},{"kind":"list","text":"Helmets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cowboy Hats"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jodhpurs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim Jeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tall Boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cowboy Boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blazers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Short Gloves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Collared Shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rat-Catchers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Polo Shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Belts"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Note: Shirts are almost always tucked into the jodhpurs or jeans"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Books"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Saddle Club series by Bonnie Bryant"},{"kind":"list","text":"Misty of Chincoteague and other horse books by Marguerite Henry"},{"kind":"list","text":"National Velvet by Enid Bagnold"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Scorpio Races by Maggie Stiefvater"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pony Club Secrets series by Stacy Gregg"},{"kind":"list","text":"Black Beauty by Anna Sewell"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flicka (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ride Like A Girl (2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Walk, Ride, Rodeo (2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wild Hearts Can’t Be Broken (1991)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"list","text":"All the Pretty Little Horses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wild Horses by Natasha Bedingfield"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horses in Heaven by Kylie Frey"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rodeo Queen by Kylie Frey"},{"kind":"heading","text":"TV Shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Free Rein (2017-2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heartland (2007-)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Saddle Club (2001)"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/a/a2/Zhorse.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20200506091132","caption":"Zhorse","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Zhorse.jpeg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0346-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/1b/Equestrian_Aesthetic_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200718140127","caption":"Equestrian Aesthetic","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Equestrian_Aesthetic_.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0346-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}